{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mini Settlers is a minimalistic city builder! Settle islands, construct cities, and design efficient logistic networks to fulfill your buildings' needs and fuel population growth to adventure into new worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/49fc1f2fb968c2bbb64b12ce2824061e.poster.avif?t=1758098064\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/49fc1f2fb968c2bbb64b12ce2824061e.webm?t=1758098064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/49fc1f2fb968c2bbb64b12ce2824061e.mp4?t=1758098064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your buildings and factories to harvest resources and create new ones to expand your cities and industries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/7087e19f4e1ba499396521c4d50aa33b.poster.avif?t=1758098064\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/7087e19f4e1ba499396521c4d50aa33b.webm?t=1758098064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/7087e19f4e1ba499396521c4d50aa33b.mp4?t=1758098064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a well-connected network of roads, trains &amp; ports between your Factories and Cities to transport and fulfill any need they may have, but be careful not to overload your supply chain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/83c38ece0fd5d89bc958bb455a571e22.poster.avif?t=1758098064\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/83c38ece0fd5d89bc958bb455a571e22.webm?t=1758098064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/83c38ece0fd5d89bc958bb455a571e22.mp4?t=1758098064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle abandoned islands by building your settlement and growing your population by fulfilling all their needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your settlements into the fertile Plains, harsh Desert, and icy Snowlands. Each with unique resources and challenges. Make them rely on each other through a connected trade and supply network to grow your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/0d80da78c7a9bae0afdd705f17fa8391.poster.avif?t=1758098064\" width=800 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/0d80da78c7a9bae0afdd705f17fa8391.webm?t=1758098064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Establish an intricate and wide logistical network</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfb Settle abandoned islands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd28 Build large cities, and increase your population</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f Balance your supply chains </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Compete with other players globally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521630/extras/d533fc3b1a35143d9b3f6730e683d7c1.avif?t=1758098064\" width=600 height=326 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting Settled!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/ec38cb1b9895cd897dc82c2f1e3853098266983a.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Accomplished!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/82fbb10b5b7c80dab34618bd54ff26d9f4a755db.jpg"},{"name":"Settler\u2019s Start!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/5c5d6e318f6306b97fa9b43206bb8a835c57d281.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Settler!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/0e95fe562bbcab63000a6c3996a526d0d4fcc765.jpg"},{"name":"Master Settler!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/1802fc55772fdc0b757bf673eb5810b816d7ac0b.jpg"},{"name":"Not Satisfied Yet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/dea81b2220bb1d7bfdc1b4e7196008b6fed5f5b7.jpg"},{"name":"Almost Satisfied!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/19fe017d6f56c4da79b824970051b00e8175485c.jpg"},{"name":"Totally Satisfied!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/510c0c7975c2f040aea5e049c890bf1cba4dcca8.jpg"},{"name":"Good Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2521630/a3992adaecb41250ff313fe8a1307cc69a6fd271.jpg"},{"name":"Great Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams